    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16cb41729389a574",
      "translationZh": "显存 |31.6 GB |29.6 GB |30.5 GB 评估是如何进行的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "698e31ef75af2c52",
      "translationZh": "我构建了一套自定义评估框架，分为 6 个层级，每个层级有 50 个测试项，全部来自我的实际生产工作负载（而非通用基准测试）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73d398aca85aef19",
      "translationZh": "相关性分类 - 这是否与该行业相关？（二元分类，50 笔已标注的交易）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73789d571e822ea9",
      "translationZh": "针式检索 - 在真实的行业播客/视频转录文本中植入事实，上下文长度分别为 64K/128K/192K/240K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db6ff60cdf7d0a66",
      "translationZh": "多转录文本问答 - 针对 3-4 份拼接在一起、已区分说话人的转录文本提问，总长度为 120K+ tokens，其中包括无法回答的对照问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51011b45e815ed56",
      "translationZh": "启用思考的推理 - 数值/逻辑问题，开启思考模式，采用贪心解码的 pass@1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "152cfba2da31fd05",
      "translationZh": "结构化提取 - 自定义提取提示词，json_mode（在 NInfer 上跳过，因为它不支持 json_mode）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "814a792dcd13a888",
      "translationZh": "工具回放 - 在每个引擎上回放录制的智能体运行轨迹（仅用于诊断，所有引擎都未通过这一项）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb761c0275aff86d",
      "translationZh": "所有测试都在各引擎之间配对进行：相同的提示词、相同的种子（42）、相同的标准答案标签。不使用 cache_prompt。统计比较采用配对聚类自助法置信区间，并使用预先注册的非劣效性界值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f6548dcdfb8f26e",
      "translationZh": "而且，当我用 Claude Code 进行开发时，我经常借助多模型咨询来进行设计、规划和代码审查。在这轮测试进行到中途时，我组织了一个由 4 个模型组成的评审小组（Codex/GPT-5、DeepSeek V4 Pro、Grok 4.5、Kimi K3），对方法进行了审查。它们发现了 10 个问题，其中包括 4 个标准答案标签错误的条目：模型实际上是对的，而我的标签是错的。我修正了所有问题，并重新运行了测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c682eae35c75bd6f",
      "translationZh": "层级 | llama.cpp | vLLM | NInfer",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b617c62a9a082035",
      "translationZh": "相关性 |86.0% |84.0% |86.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d38ff213f944ca1e",
      "translationZh": "大海捞针（条件性） |100% (29/29) |100% (41/41) |100% (41/41)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f751a6485231f8f6",
      "translationZh": "转录文本问答 |82.0% |78.0% |88.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29913328f5d8e96e",
      "translationZh": "推理 |100% |100% |98.0%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a078a27a390ff7f",
      "translationZh": "提取 |F1 0.300 |F1 0.350 |已跳过",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16dbdaa0a0cce63f",
      "translationZh": "工具重放 |0% |全部出错 |0% 针的数量不同，是因为 llama.cpp 的 196K 上下文无法容纳 192K 的条目（需要为 max_tokens + 额外余量留出空间）。NInfer 和 vLLM 都能正常处理 192K。所有引擎在其能容纳的每个针上都获得了 100% 的分数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b98113138116b760",
      "translationZh": "统计比较（NInfer 对比 llama.cpp，自助法）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d9833d107c75e06",
      "translationZh": "针：delta = -0.29（NInfer 更好，p=0.0006）——这完全源于上下文容量，而非检索质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cc420b23202a1b6",
      "translationZh": "转录文本问答：delta = -0.03，p=0.69——无差异",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e6cfd4dbb27303dc",
      "translationZh": "推理：delta = +0.02，p=0.72——无差异",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a948a3bc724525a",
      "translationZh": "相关性：McNemar p=1.0——完全相同",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8aeb8d200cd6aefa",
      "translationZh": "工具重放：delta = 0.0——两者同样失败",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cd9e30c87621c62",
      "translationZh": "结论：所有引擎的质量在统计上均无显著差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "effce86e9023eaf8",
      "translationZh": "速度结果（性能探测，服务端计时）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b3e16b6722e12da",
      "translationZh": "上下文 | llama.cpp | NInfer | 加速比",
